# JumpStart takes no configuration and holds no secrets.
#
# There is no backend, no API key and no analytics. Every number in the app is
# generated locally from a fixed seed, and all learner state lives in the
# browser's localStorage. This file exists to document that, so nobody has to
# read the source to find out whether something is missing.
#
# If the app ever grows a backend, credentials belong here as empty keys and
# never in committed source.
